 "title": "The Disney Sound Source on the parallel port",
 "kind": "register",
 "scope": "disney",
 "covers": "the three printer-interface registers a Disney Sound Source answers at its base port, as Disney's programmer's guide gives them: the data register that carries a sample, the status register that reports the FIFO, and the control register that carries SELECT on pin 17",
